Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.57,0:00:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,尤里  早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,柯梅特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,派對呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,派對？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天就結束啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你清醒點  好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不會錯的  輪迴已經結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思帶著我原本持有的銀鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,離開這個次元  去了另一端
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,為了救我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,銀鑰匙已經不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不會發生輪迴了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,尤里里  要不要一起去吃飯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,SQ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思他…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.11,0:01:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.03,0:01:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,看來你的記憶還有點問題呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你遲早會明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,現實中沒有你說的那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:58.49,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1300)\blur5\pos(1630,930)}後記
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:02:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思跨越那扇門之後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就從大家的記憶中消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在這扇門另一端的另一個宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.11,0:03:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是與這個宇宙互不干擾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,彼此獨立的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.11,0:03:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,前往另一端的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思就不存在於這個宇宙了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就像什麼也沒發生過
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,本艦收到軍方的靠港要求
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,應該是因為我們剛從盧安逃出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.43,0:03:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,LeVi應該已經證明\N艦上沒有古諾希亞反應了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.60,0:03:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是為了保險起見吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,軍方那些人就是很多疑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,最好別隨便反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,聽命行事比較好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,若是無視要求
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.86,0:03:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,軍方將依宇宙飛航法強制執行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:04:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,這根本不是要求  是命令吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,軍港…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,會調查身分  對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嚇唬人罷了  不會真的動手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我認為無視也無妨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我也贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,沒時間陪他們玩這種鬧劇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果是認真的  事情會很嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易才從盧安逃出來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.68,0:04:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想坐牢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你覺得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你是軍人吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我來自第52號基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,軍方…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得還是去一趟比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼辦呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,以柔制剛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,現在就先順從吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,變更航路
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,發射識別訊號
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,將航向控制權交給對方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.43,0:05:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,確認航道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.94,0:05:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,軍方要求本艦關閉所有防禦系統
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,請問是否接受？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,接受
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,接受要求
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,現在關閉所有防禦系統
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那我們能下船嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,只要辦理正式手續
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,應該是可以下船的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,反正要等很久吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那也只能去打發時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,會擔心的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我看還是留在船上比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.90,0:05:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不要  我都說我不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷淡喔  不要這樣嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是尤里啊  你也一起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,派對時間啦  如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你興致還真高昂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,廢話  這可是軍港耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,有什麼特別的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有紅燈區啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,幾千年來什麼也沒變  真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,受慾望擺佈  簡直愚蠢至極
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.18,0:06:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛？講那種掃興的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,第52號基地？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我在找人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,想說會不會有人認識他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,52…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我記得…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙是從那來的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我想請教一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.95,0:07:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啊  不過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你該不會想免費問吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那你想問什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有叫塞思的人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.05,0:07:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經試著查過去這一百年的成員了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.39,0:07:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是這麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你指什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事  謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你能找到那個重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.91,0:08:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,果然連存在本身都消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思這個人在這個宇宙中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.45,0:08:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,根本從來不曾誕生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我是塞思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那一段回憶也不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那一段也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼能這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.22,0:08:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不用這麼戒備啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我說了要請客耶  可以吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,尤里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你是誰啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我是從盧安來的  在這裡隔離
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,因為可能受到古諾希亞汙染
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,古…古諾希亞？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快…快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.37,0:09:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都很怕古諾希亞汙染呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,以一般常理來想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,應該就會發現軍方不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,讓有汙染風險的人進城
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是因為你的演技太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.31,0:09:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,可能在不知不覺間變得很會說謊了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,像是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡保存著很古老的宇宙飛航圖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,這是阿拉科西亞星系\N一千年份的航行紀錄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.79,0:09:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然還有這種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,要看看嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣就能確認\N船艦是如何通過這一帶的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.89,0:10:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,對宇宙飛航管制員是必要資訊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,阿拉科西亞有很多小行星  對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你很了解耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是聽塞思說的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是你昨天提到的那個人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然大家都說是因為記憶障礙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我想聽你說那個人的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,說出來或許心裡會好過一點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他去了另一端？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.81,0:10:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我想是因為他穿過次元之門
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,去了另一個宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在這裡就變成不存在的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.28,0:10:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你還是無法相信吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我無法想像
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:11:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但我並不認為你在說謊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那位叫塞思的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在另一端的世界活著
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  雖然我無從確認
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但應該也結束輪迴了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,結束？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他在前往門的那一端時說過…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.85,0:11:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在門的另一端
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能不斷輪迴  直到輪迴終結
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,直到在另一個宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,把鑰匙交給你為止
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想他一定在另一個宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,已經把鑰匙交給我了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我也不太懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可是塞思不在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而必須收下銀鑰匙的你卻還在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起  我多嘴了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,應該不是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:11:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,拉琪奧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.51,0:12:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我突然想到有點急事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,銀鑰匙？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.34,0:12:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你有興趣啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然也有人想靠它回到過去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但這玩意最可怕的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在於無法自己決定何時結束
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,結束？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.62,0:12:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,這玩意在被資訊填滿之前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不會離開寄生的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,只要沒有填滿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,輪迴就會一直持續
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,永遠被囚禁在時間迴圈之中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,拉琪奧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我有件事想請教你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.55,0:13:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,拉琪奧  你覺得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思在那一端已經結束輪迴了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是你的一廂情願罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我就直說了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娜說的才是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,為了連結因果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思理應把銀鑰匙\N交給還在這個宇宙的你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他恐怕明知道會如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,卻依然去了另一個宇宙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,為了救你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思還在另一個宇宙持續輪迴？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.71,0:14:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,明知道會變成那樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,希皮？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,少廢話  快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.94,0:14:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是尤里嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,沙明
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,來得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.65,0:14:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我剛跟希皮喝酒\N結果那混蛋竟然落跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,算了  你陪我也行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…你要去哪裡啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,錢包來囉  酒瓶開起來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你也喝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.63,0:14:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這是到目前為止的帳單
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,總之你先幫我墊一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.59,0:14:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧  這金額太扯了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託  求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,來  張嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,難怪希皮叫我快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙竟然說他只對貓感興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,煩死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒不覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,耍帥也沒用啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你應該也有一、兩個想睡的女人吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我才沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.89,0:15:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我最討厭你這樣裝清高的傢伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,再說…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.35,0:15:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我有很重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,做了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你想的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不敢行動  只是眼巴巴看著喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,該不會是「我很怕受傷」那套吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼不說話了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,被我說中了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果追得上  我也想去追啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但我根本無能為力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有辦法…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,已經沒有辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他哭了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好可愛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.44,0:16:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真的已經沒有辦法了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不會只是想找藉口放棄吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.05,0:17:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,軍方的檢查怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才已經結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.60,0:17:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,完全沒有古諾希亞反應
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,順利放行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.19,0:17:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.77,0:17:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,拉琪奧呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,您說拉琪奧閣下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他剛才好像已經回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.82,0:17:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,拉琪奧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.74,0:17:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你果然來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那把銀鑰匙是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟是難得的研究對象
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把它買下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你先冷靜下來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想讓它寄生在自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,填滿資訊後  開啟那扇門
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.81,0:18:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,然後去追塞思  對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有別的辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你覺得辦得到嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只能試試看了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,因為塞思還在那一端繼續輪迴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.82,0:18:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思的輪迴就永遠不會結束
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才叫你先冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,說到底  你覺得為什麼會變成這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.34,0:18:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是為了讓你活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的尤里和你\N無法共存於同一個宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以塞思不得不穿過那扇門
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:19:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你追過去會怎樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,只是讓同樣的問題再次發生罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.27,0:19:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那樣塞思的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,還有你填滿銀鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.65,0:19:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,才好不容易開啟的門
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.57,0:19:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,都會變得毫無意義
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,用邏輯思考應該很容易懂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那我到底該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思在那一端結束不了輪迴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.13,0:19:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,這個宇宙原本就不存在名為塞思的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,思考不存在的人是沒有意義的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是宇宙的真理
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.89,0:19:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可以這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.27,0:19:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,既然這樣  雖然不情願  我就直說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這是塞思希望的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我無法反駁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,從頭到尾  拉琪奧說的都是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思他希望
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我在這個宇宙活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.05,0:20:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,然後  他自己從這裡消失
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.94,0:20:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…尤里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.32,0:20:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,乙女
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.99,0:20:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮的咖啡廳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是塞思喜歡的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.91,0:20:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜錯了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.62,0:20:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你說對了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然能猜到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  感覺不太像您喜歡的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我才這麼猜想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你完全不記得塞思的事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.97,0:21:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.26,0:21:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係  不用在意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.14,0:21:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那是理所當然的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟在這個宇宙…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是…\N- 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然想不起他的長相\N聲音  還有模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.57,0:21:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不知為何  一聽到那個名字
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就會刺痛一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.95,0:21:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,刺痛？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這附近
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,尤里？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.30,0:21:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,果然沒那麼容易消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不會變成什麼也沒發生過
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就算跨越了次元
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,跨越了宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是心意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.19,0:21:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,思念  比一切都強大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.82,0:22:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,拉琪奧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,拉琪奧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.17,0:22:46.64,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Loo% Who% Loop and fall
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.64,0:22:48.15,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}dare dare dare
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.32,0:22:52.77,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Loo% Who% Loop and lose
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.77,0:22:54.39,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}spy spiral
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.93,0:22:56.56,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}お前は誰だ？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:23:00.77,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}終わりなき迷宮の友愛騙し絵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.95,0:23:02.80,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一生の幻想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.80,0:23:07.20,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}死ぬまで吐かせて極上ペテンwords
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.09,0:23:13.39,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey, wake up 真っさらさらのmorning fake
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.39,0:23:15.24,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}昨日も飲んだっけ？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:18.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}夢はbitter or sweet? Parallel line
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.37,0:23:21.75,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}繰り返される運命に苦悩しな
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.97,0:23:33.83,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Loo% Who% Loo% Who%
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.83,0:23:34.83,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Who? What? Loop?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:39.85,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}もう誰かと死んじゃいたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.85,0:23:43.35,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}もう誰かと信じ合いたいって liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.35,0:23:44.94,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}狼よおお神よ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.94,0:23:46.52,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}シロでもクロでもcall me王
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:49.44,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Loop, loop, Loo% 苦悩支配
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.44,0:23:50.82,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}もう誰かと死んじゃいたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:52.40,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}もう誰かと信じ合いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.40,0:23:54.65,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}信/神/真/嘘/脳支配
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.17,0:22:46.64,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Loo% Who% 輪迴與墜落
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.64,0:22:48.15,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}膽敢 膽敢 膽敢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.32,0:22:52.77,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Loo% Who% 輪迴與慘敗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.77,0:22:54.39,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}間諜螺旋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.93,0:22:56.56,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}你究竟是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:23:00.77,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}無盡迷宮裡描繪友愛的錯視圖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.95,0:23:02.80,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一生的幻想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.80,0:23:07.20,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}吐露極致的詐欺台詞直到死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.09,0:23:13.39,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}嘿 醒醒 嶄新的早晨是場騙局
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.39,0:23:15.24,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}昨天也喝了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:18.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}夢境是苦？是甜？ 平行線
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.37,0:23:21.75,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}在反覆重演的命運裡苦惱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.97,0:23:33.83,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Loo% Who% Loo% Who%
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.83,0:23:34.83,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}是誰？是什麼？是輪迴？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:39.85,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}說想乾脆跟某人一起死
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.85,0:23:43.35,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}說想乾脆跟某人互相信賴 是騙子？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.35,0:23:44.94,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}狼啊 神靈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.94,0:23:46.52,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}無論無辜有罪都稱我為王
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:49.44,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}輪迴 輪迴 Loo% 受苦惱支配
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.44,0:23:50.82,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}想乾脆跟某人一起死
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:52.40,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}想乾脆跟某人互相信賴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.40,0:23:54.65,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}信/神/實/虛/支配腦袋
